{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25213","headline":"姑熟杂咏 凌[歊]台 · 李赤","name":"姑熟杂咏 凌[歊]台","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旷望登古台，台高极人目。\n叠嶂列远空，闲花杂平陆。\n白云入窗牖，野翠生松竹。\n欲览碑上文，苔侵岂堪读。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李赤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25213.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25213","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}